00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,536
B, nitroethane.

2
00:00:01,536 --> 00:00:07,955
Silver nitrite is covalent, so the attack comes through nitrogen, giving the nitro compound.

3
00:00:07,955 --> 00:00:15,611
Potassium nitrite, being ionic, attacks through oxygen and gives ethyl nitrite, the trap in option A.

